{"id":"83c37bed44770f30","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-operator-spectrum.md","title":"Operator Spectrum","display":"df-operator-spectrum — Operator Spectrum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-operator-spectrum","aliases":["58-df-operator-spectrum"],"display":"df-operator-spectrum — Operator Spectrum","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-resolvent-set.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-operator-spectrum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-operator-spectrum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-operator-spectrum — Operator Spectrum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59c5498c726aa6df\" href=\"?note=59c5498c726aa6df\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-resolvent-set.md\">../batch15/58-df-resolvent-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"630c319f5a2106ce\" href=\"?note=630c319f5a2106ce\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md\">../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,X,I_X\\in V\">\\(S,T,X,I_X\\in V\\)</span> (参数)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\)</span> (全参数有界线性算子谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S\\)</span> (全参数复 Banach 代数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"630c319f5a2106ce\" href=\"?note=630c319f5a2106ce\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md\">../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Invertible}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Invertible}_S\\)</span> (代数内可逆谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"59c5498c726aa6df\" href=\"?note=59c5498c726aa6df\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-resolvent-set.md\">../batch15/58-df-resolvent-set.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (本文件定义的谱关系)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrumStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrumStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> 为下式定义的全结构谱谓词；原有四参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrum}_S\\)</span> 保持不变。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>最后一式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D,K_X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X\">\\(\\mathcal D,K_X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X\\)</span> 取 normed-space 文件中同一组固定背景选择函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_X(T)\">\\(\\sigma_X(T)\\)</span> 仅在该式列出的定义域上使用。其他两种谱关系的参数量化保持各自断言所示。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>最后一式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\odot_X=\\cdot_X\">\\(\\odot_X=\\cdot_X\\)</span>；右侧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_X\">\\(\\cdot_X\\)</span> 是 normed-space 指定的标量作用，不是另一个独立选择。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrumStructure}_S(S,T,X,I_X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\mathcal B,+_{\\mathcal B},\\odot_{\\mathcal B},\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B},\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathcal B}\\in V\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathcal B=\\{A\\in X^X\\mid\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(A;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;\nX,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;\\mathbb C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(\\mathcal B,+_{\\mathcal B},\\odot_{\\mathcal B},\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B},\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathcal B})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_X,X,X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(I_X(x)=x)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A,C\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\n+_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle A,C\\rangle)(x)=+_X(\\langle A(x),C(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\cdot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle A,C\\rangle)(x)=A(C(x))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\odot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle\\lambda,A\\rangle)(x)=\\odot_X(\\langle\\lambda,A(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land I_X,T\\in\\mathcal B\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle I_X,A\\rangle)=A=\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle A,I_X\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land S=\\left\\{\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\ \\middle|\\\n\\neg\\mathrm{Invertible}_S\\!\\left(\n+_{\\mathcal B}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\odot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle\\lambda,I_X\\rangle),\n\\odot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle-1,T\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right);\\mathcal B,\\cdot_{\\mathcal B},I_X\\right)\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrumStructure}_S(S,T,X,I_X,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\mathcal B,+_{\\mathcal B},\\odot_{\\mathcal B},\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B},\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathcal B}\\in V\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathcal B=\\{A\\in X^X\\mid\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(A;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;\nX,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;\\mathbb C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(\\mathcal B,+_{\\mathcal B},\\odot_{\\mathcal B},\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B},\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathcal B})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_X,X,X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(I_X(x)=x)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A,C\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\n+_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle A,C\\rangle)(x)=+_X(\\langle A(x),C(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\cdot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle A,C\\rangle)(x)=A(C(x))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\odot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle\\lambda,A\\rangle)(x)=\\odot_X(\\langle\\lambda,A(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land I_X,T\\in\\mathcal B\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle I_X,A\\rangle)=A=\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle A,I_X\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land S=\\left\\{\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\ \\middle|\\\n\\neg\\mathrm{Invertible}_S\\!\\left(\n+_{\\mathcal B}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\odot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle\\lambda,I_X\\rangle),\n\\odot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle-1,T\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right);\\mathcal B,\\cdot_{\\mathcal B},I_X\\right)\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}operator\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrum}_S(S,T,X,I_X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\mathcal B,+_{\\mathcal B},\\odot_{\\mathcal B},\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B},\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathcal B}\\in V\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathcal B=\\{A\\in X^X\\mid\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(A;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;\nX,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;\\mathbb C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(\\mathcal B,+_{\\mathcal B},\\odot_{\\mathcal B},\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B},\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathcal B})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_X,X,X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(I_X(x)=x)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A,C\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\n+_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle A,C\\rangle)(x)=+_X(\\langle A(x),C(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\cdot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle A,C\\rangle)(x)=A(C(x))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\odot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle\\lambda,A\\rangle)(x)=\\odot_X(\\langle\\lambda,A(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land I_X,T\\in\\mathcal B\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle I_X,A\\rangle)=A=\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle A,I_X\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land S=\\left\\{\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\ \\middle|\\\n\\neg\\mathrm{Invertible}_S\\!\\left(\n+_{\\mathcal B}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\odot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle\\lambda,I_X\\rangle),\n\\odot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle-1,T\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right);\\mathcal B,\\cdot_{\\mathcal B},I_X\\right)\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}operator\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrum}_S(S,T,X,I_X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\mathcal B,+_{\\mathcal B},\\odot_{\\mathcal B},\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B},\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathcal B}\\in V\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathcal B=\\{A\\in X^X\\mid\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(A;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;\nX,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;\\mathbb C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(\\mathcal B,+_{\\mathcal B},\\odot_{\\mathcal B},\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B},\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathcal B})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_X,X,X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(I_X(x)=x)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A,C\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\n+_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle A,C\\rangle)(x)=+_X(\\langle A(x),C(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\cdot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle A,C\\rangle)(x)=A(C(x))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\odot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle\\lambda,A\\rangle)(x)=\\odot_X(\\langle\\lambda,A(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land I_X,T\\in\\mathcal B\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle I_X,A\\rangle)=A=\n\\cdot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle A,I_X\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land S=\\left\\{\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\ \\middle|\\\n\\neg\\mathrm{Invertible}_S\\!\\left(\n+_{\\mathcal B}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\odot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle\\lambda,I_X\\rangle),\n\\odot_{\\mathcal B}(\\langle-1,T\\rangle)\n\\right\\rangle\\right);\\mathcal B,\\cdot_{\\mathcal B},I_X\\right)\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}operator\\text{-}spectrum\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\nX\\in\\mathcal D\\land K_X=\\mathbb C\\land\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;\\mathbb C)\n\\ \\to\\ \\sigma_X(T)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup\\{S\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb C):\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrumStructure}_S(S,T,X,\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\},+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}operator\\text{-}spectrum\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\nX\\in\\mathcal D\\land K_X=\\mathbb C\\land\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;\\mathbb C)\n\\ \\to\\ \\sigma_X(T)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup\\{S\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb C):\\mathrm{OperatorSpectrumStructure}_S(S,T,X,\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\},+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The operator spectrum generalizes eigenvalues.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 的点态加法、标量乘法、复合乘法和恒等算子均显式绑定到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的算子结构；谱集合调用的是 resolvent 原子实际定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Invertible}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Invertible}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>For self-adjoint operators, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(T) \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}\">\\(\\sigma(T) \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-resolvent-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"59c5498c72